{#
  «شاهدته مؤخراً» on Home — the products this visitor opened, newest first.

  | Variable          | Type    | Description                              |
  |-------------------|---------|------------------------------------------|
  | component.title   | ?string | The heading; the locale's when empty     |
  | component.count   | ?int    | How many products at most                |
  | position          | int     | Sorting number, from zero                |

  Added at the owner's request on 2026-10-12, from the design's own parts: the
  list is read from this browser by `partials/recently-viewed.js`, which renders
  Salla's products slider — the theme's product card — into the placeholder
  below, or removes the section when the visitor has opened nothing yet. So a
  first-time visitor sees no empty heading. Recorded in DERIVED-DECISIONS.md.

  The placeholder is the section panel itself, like every other row on Home,
  so the panel leaves with it when the visitor has nothing to show.
#}
<section data-testid="store-home-recently-viewed" class="s-block recently-viewed container">
    <div class="s-block__panel" data-recently-viewed
         data-recently-viewed-title="{{ component.title|default(trans('theme.recently_viewed.title')) }}"
         data-recently-viewed-limit="{{ component.count|default(8) }}"></div>
</section>
